WEBVTT

00:06.460 --> 00:08.380
W-wait, please!

00:08.380 --> 00:13.670
I'm Liliel's photographer!
I just want to talk!

00:14.130 --> 00:15.920
Would that be okay?

01:50.040 --> 01:54.790
<b>Together With You</b>

01:57.920 --> 02:00.080
I can hold it for you if you want.

02:00.540 --> 02:02.500
He's the guy from the store!

02:08.750 --> 02:10.170
Thank goodness.

02:16.750 --> 02:19.960
<b>RUMBLE</b>

02:17.460 --> 02:19.460
What did you want to talk about?

02:19.960 --> 02:26.920
<b>PANIC PANIC</b>

02:20.040 --> 02:21.250
Sorry!

02:21.250 --> 02:24.040
Suddenly getting approached by some
random guy probably freaked you out!

02:24.040 --> 02:26.790
I'm not really good at talking to new people.

02:26.790 --> 02:29.250
I had to work up the courage to catch you.

02:29.830 --> 02:33.500
Other people need to work up the
courage to talk to people, too?

02:33.750 --> 02:37.040
I wanted to ask you a question.

02:37.630 --> 02:40.790
I want to believe all cosplayers are friends and allies.

02:41.210 --> 02:44.040
H-how do you feel about Liliel?

02:44.920 --> 02:48.420
I love her! I love her so much!
I want to be her friend!

02:52.540 --> 02:54.960
So, uh...

02:54.960 --> 02:58.540
I'm guessing you don't like her.

02:59.080 --> 03:00.210
No!

03:00.210 --> 03:05.630
When that ranking came out,
I was kind of annoyed about it.

03:05.630 --> 03:07.580
Like, my Liliel deserves to be number one.

03:07.580 --> 03:11.540
I'm sorry I ranked higher!
She's way more adorable than me!

03:12.130 --> 03:16.250
I know cosplay's not a competition,
and the ranking doesn't matter.

03:16.250 --> 03:20.750
I should just be happy that Liliel's having fun.

03:20.750 --> 03:25.210
But I still feel weird about it,
and I don't know what to do.

03:25.580 --> 03:27.500
Do you feel the same way?

03:27.500 --> 03:29.210
Were you annoyed to get fourth?

03:29.960 --> 03:34.330
If you think Liliel's your
rival and aren't a fan of her,

03:34.330 --> 03:36.380
could you tell me why you feel that way?

03:36.790 --> 03:39.580
I think it'd help me figure out how to feel, too.

03:40.250 --> 03:41.960
He's taking this so seriously.

03:42.500 --> 03:45.040
But oh, god, he's got it all wrong!

03:45.290 --> 03:47.000
It's okay if you don't like her.

03:47.000 --> 03:50.540
Real otaku don't judge someone
for what they like or don't like.

03:51.250 --> 03:52.710
They don't judge...

03:53.380 --> 03:57.080
Some cosplayers want to try
and be better than other cosplayers,

03:57.080 --> 03:58.420
and that's totally fine.

03:58.750 --> 04:03.080
If that's why you don't like Liliel,
I'm totally okay with that.

04:03.670 --> 04:06.630
I just want to understand.

04:06.630 --> 04:08.580
He wants to understand?

04:08.580 --> 04:10.580
He wants to know what I'm thinking?

04:11.130 --> 04:14.920
He's taking this so seriously...
It's kind of weird.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.670
Yet I don't feel uncomfortable.

04:19.170 --> 04:21.830
I feel like he'd listen to what I have to say.

04:22.380 --> 04:25.290
But... I'm sorry.

04:25.880 --> 04:29.170
I can't get my voice to work.

04:30.920 --> 04:34.210
If you talking is hard for you, I can wait.

04:34.210 --> 04:35.080
Wait?

04:35.080 --> 04:37.250
If I'm not bothering you, I guess.

04:38.380 --> 04:40.130
I'll even turn the other way.

05:09.130 --> 05:12.250
How long have we been here?
Five, ten minutes?

05:12.250 --> 05:14.960
He's seriously going to wait?

05:17.460 --> 05:19.580
I'm breathing calmly again.

05:27.960 --> 05:29.000
I...

05:29.750 --> 05:30.670
Yes?

05:38.540 --> 05:42.790
I wanted to thank you... for helping me.

05:46.080 --> 05:48.170
I spoke!

05:50.880 --> 05:52.830
He didn't want me to say that!

05:52.830 --> 05:55.040
I'm being weird again!

05:55.040 --> 05:58.250
Sure, no problem!

05:59.080 --> 06:02.040
He... responded to me.

06:10.380 --> 06:11.830
Over here!

06:12.080 --> 06:13.040
Smile!

06:16.670 --> 06:20.960
Does Nonoa-chan really hate me?

06:22.290 --> 06:28.170
Then if she had fans here,
would they hate me too?

06:28.500 --> 06:32.960
Wouldn't they hate me for bringing
Liliel to a Cinderella Stars event?!

06:32.960 --> 06:36.750
The more I think,
the more I feel like everyone hates me!

06:44.170 --> 06:46.630
Sorry, I need to take a break!

06:50.290 --> 06:52.290
I'm sorry, Sensei.

06:52.290 --> 06:55.920
You okay? You're totally out of it today.

06:56.170 --> 06:58.830
Liliel!

06:58.830 --> 07:00.080
Nagomi-san?!

07:00.080 --> 07:01.540
What's wrong with you?!

07:01.540 --> 07:03.630
You don't look like you're enjoying this at all!

07:04.250 --> 07:06.790
Did I put too much pressure on you?

07:06.790 --> 07:09.580
No, you didn't put any pressure on me at all.

07:09.580 --> 07:11.250
At least feel a little, sheesh.

07:17.000 --> 07:21.500
You're worried about Nonoa,
and if she likes you or not.

07:22.630 --> 07:25.000
Why're you so worked up about that?

07:25.000 --> 07:29.170
Who cares if someone doesn't like you.

07:29.460 --> 07:32.750
Don't look at me! I've moved on from that.

07:34.790 --> 07:36.290
Look, Liliel...

07:36.670 --> 07:38.540
I know I just figured this out,

07:38.540 --> 07:40.500
so I'm the last person who
should be lecturing you, but...

07:40.500 --> 07:43.710
I love all cosplayers.

07:44.170 --> 07:49.170
But that doesn't mean that
everyone has to like me, too.

07:49.170 --> 07:52.080
Everyone's entitled to their own opinions.

07:52.500 --> 07:55.460
As much as I want everyone to like me,

07:55.460 --> 07:57.630
I can't control how they feel about me.

07:57.960 --> 08:01.250
I don't have psychic powers.

08:01.250 --> 08:05.380
I can't move rocks with my mind,
or manpiulate someone's thoughts.

08:06.170 --> 08:09.830
So if someone doesn't like me,
I should just accept it?

08:09.830 --> 08:10.960
No.

08:10.960 --> 08:14.630
I'm saying you shouldn't waste your time
wondering if someone likes you or not.

08:14.960 --> 08:17.500
It doesn't matter what other people think.

08:18.080 --> 08:20.000
What matters is what you think.

08:20.630 --> 08:23.670
That's the only thing that should matter to you.

08:25.670 --> 08:28.960
What do you think of her, Liliel?

08:29.670 --> 08:32.920
If you don't like her,
you don't have to be her friend.

08:32.920 --> 08:36.170
Just ignore her.
You're entitled to your opinion, too.

08:38.540 --> 08:39.750
I...

08:41.920 --> 08:44.080
I want to be her friend.

08:44.080 --> 08:48.790
I mean, cosplayers all love the same thing!
We're all on the same team!

08:50.460 --> 08:52.080
I totally agree.

08:52.380 --> 08:53.750
So go get her!

08:55.250 --> 08:57.540
If you tell her how you feel,

08:57.540 --> 09:01.080
you might just change the
way she feels about you.

09:01.330 --> 09:03.630
Right! Thank you!

09:11.960 --> 09:13.330
I said something.

09:13.960 --> 09:16.130
I finally told someone how I feel.

09:17.710 --> 09:19.130
And now...

09:20.040 --> 09:22.080
I have to tell her, too!

09:22.830 --> 09:24.830
She probably hates me,

09:24.830 --> 09:28.330
but I don't want this misunderstanding
to go on any longer!

09:27.080 --> 09:28.460
<b>RRRRUMBLE</b>

09:28.710 --> 09:31.540
I won't even ask to be friends.

09:31.540 --> 09:35.460
I just need a chance to tell her how I feel.

09:36.670 --> 09:38.250
I love you.

09:38.880 --> 09:40.920
I have to make sure Liliel-chan hears that!

09:42.040 --> 09:43.460
Nonoa-chan!

09:44.920 --> 09:46.210
Liliel-chan!

09:46.920 --> 09:48.210
It's okay if she hates me.

09:48.830 --> 09:50.080
I love her.

09:50.920 --> 09:52.420
I need her to know!

09:53.250 --> 09:54.210
Sensei!

09:54.210 --> 09:56.830
Okumura, where have you been?

09:56.830 --> 09:57.880
Where's Ririsa?

09:57.880 --> 10:00.710
She went to go look for Nonoa.

10:03.330 --> 10:05.210
I'm sure she's not a bad person.

10:05.210 --> 10:07.670
She's just a little awkward.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.670
Ririsa will understand!

10:10.920 --> 10:12.210
Nonoa-chan!

10:12.710 --> 10:14.960
C-can we get some pictures of you?

10:15.290 --> 10:16.460
We've been looking for you!

10:20.080 --> 10:22.500
I'm sorry, I'm in a hurry!

10:22.500 --> 10:24.830
I-is that a no?

10:24.830 --> 10:28.710
No, Nonoa-chan doesn't talk
cause she's in character!

10:28.710 --> 10:30.500
Then she means yes?

10:30.880 --> 10:31.960
No!

10:31.960 --> 10:35.580
That terrifying glare that
makes your blood run cold!

10:35.580 --> 10:37.710
The perfect Coulia impression!

10:37.710 --> 10:40.420
It's almost a little too scary...

10:40.630 --> 10:44.000
T-thank you so much!

10:44.250 --> 10:46.580
Why is this happening to me?!

10:46.790 --> 10:48.920
Nonoa-chan's doing photos now!

10:48.920 --> 10:50.250
For real?! Let's go!

10:52.380 --> 10:56.420
How long is this gonna take?! Come on!

10:59.960 --> 11:03.790
At 1 PM, we'll have our Rock-Paper-Scissors
tournament at the main stage!

11:04.080 --> 11:05.130
To prep for the tournament,

11:05.130 --> 11:07.420
our photo areas will close at 12:30. Thank you!

11:07.420 --> 11:09.040
Already?! That's in thirty minutes!

11:07.420 --> 11:09.040
our photo areas will close at 12:30. Thank you!

11:09.040 --> 11:10.080
Already?! That's in thirty minutes!

11:10.080 --> 11:13.250
But I guess this event is about
more than just cosplay...

11:13.630 --> 11:15.750
Look, there's Liliel!

11:16.420 --> 11:17.960
We saw you on Mr. Camera's blog!

11:17.960 --> 11:19.500
We're huge fans!

11:19.500 --> 11:21.880
Huh?! T-thank you!

11:22.670 --> 11:25.580
I have fans? I could cry!

11:26.790 --> 11:29.420
But I have to go find Nonoa-chan!

11:31.920 --> 11:33.830
Hey, could we get a picture of you?

11:34.380 --> 11:38.420
We heard you were here and
have been looking all over for you!

11:38.420 --> 11:40.210
There's only thirty minutes left!

11:40.630 --> 11:43.710
I-I can't tell them no...

11:43.710 --> 11:49.960
But if I let them take pictures,
I won't be able to catch Nonoa-chan...

11:52.040 --> 11:54.210
<b>Cinderella Stars</b>

11:55.080 --> 11:56.330
Liliel!

11:57.210 --> 11:58.420
Nagomi-san?

11:58.420 --> 11:59.960
It's really her!

11:59.960 --> 12:02.670
Sorry, am I interrupting?

12:02.670 --> 12:04.330
Uh, no, but...

12:04.750 --> 12:07.460
Wait, both of them are here?

12:07.460 --> 12:09.420
She posted a picture with her before.

12:09.420 --> 12:13.210
I'm really sorry, but could I take pictures here?

12:10.210 --> 12:15.210
<b>GLARE</b>

12:13.210 --> 12:15.250
Nowhere else can handle my crowd.

12:15.250 --> 12:17.330
Y-yeah, of course!

12:17.710 --> 12:20.250
I'm so sorry to interrupt!

12:20.540 --> 12:23.130
No, no, you're good!

12:23.130 --> 12:25.460
I can't believe Nagomi-chan is talking to me.

12:25.460 --> 12:28.500
You two can cut straight to the front of the line.

12:30.630 --> 12:32.080
The front of the line...

12:32.080 --> 12:33.710
...for a Heavenly Queen?!

12:34.750 --> 12:36.040
Nagomi-san...

12:37.080 --> 12:38.040
Go.

12:38.830 --> 12:39.630
I'm sorry!

12:39.630 --> 12:40.920
Wait, Liliel-chan!

12:40.920 --> 12:43.710
I'm... Good with Nagomi-chan.

12:43.710 --> 12:44.750
What?! Dude!

12:48.330 --> 12:50.580
Why am I always like this?

12:50.920 --> 12:54.080
I should just tell people how I feel.

12:54.080 --> 12:55.960
We'd all be better off...

12:58.880 --> 13:00.790
What am I supposed to do?

13:01.130 --> 13:02.830
What can I do?

13:03.170 --> 13:04.540
Nonoa-chan!

13:05.290 --> 13:06.540
Liliel!

13:06.540 --> 13:07.750
Both Rising Stars...

13:07.750 --> 13:08.920
Liliel-chan?

13:09.330 --> 13:10.460
Excuse me! Sorry! Really sorry!

13:10.460 --> 13:11.790
Excuse me! Sorry! Really sorry!

13:10.460 --> 13:11.790
Why?

13:16.580 --> 13:18.670
Will you take pictures with me?!

13:20.460 --> 13:22.130
They're both here!

13:22.130 --> 13:24.170
Hell yeah!

13:24.170 --> 13:25.670
Didn't Nonoa-chan just ghost her?

13:25.670 --> 13:26.580
Didn't Nonoa-chan just ghost her?

13:25.670 --> 13:26.580
Why?

13:26.580 --> 13:27.420
Did she?

13:27.920 --> 13:30.330
After what I did to her...

13:30.880 --> 13:31.960
She still...

13:35.170 --> 13:38.170
Say something.
This time, I have to say something!

13:39.920 --> 13:45.040
M-my voice worked fine before!
All I have to say is 'yes'!

13:45.580 --> 13:47.420
I just have to nod!

13:48.250 --> 13:52.580
But the thought of talking to someone
I like so much is terrifying...

13:53.540 --> 13:55.630
Does she not like me?

13:55.630 --> 13:57.380
Am I bothering her?

13:58.130 --> 13:59.830
I'm being awkward.

13:59.830 --> 14:01.710
She told me no before.

14:03.170 --> 14:05.210
What matters is what you think.

14:09.380 --> 14:10.380
Let's do this!

14:14.920 --> 14:17.210
She might not like me,

14:17.210 --> 14:23.420
but I want to believe that all cosplayers are allies,
are my friends!

14:23.420 --> 14:29.460
No matter what you might think of me,
I still want to cosplay with you!

14:31.000 --> 14:32.380
She's an angel...

14:44.210 --> 14:47.750
Descending from heaven to take the stage, Liliel!

14:49.080 --> 14:50.380
It's Liliel...

14:51.130 --> 14:53.250
She's here, in real life!

14:55.040 --> 15:00.250
Who am I, then?
Who's the girl standing next to her?

15:01.830 --> 15:02.790
S...

15:09.540 --> 15:14.880
Sparkling like transparent ice,
Cobalt Blue, the seventh Cinderella...

15:16.380 --> 15:17.290
Coulia!

15:19.920 --> 15:21.710
She spoke!

15:27.250 --> 15:28.670
Nonoa-chan...

15:31.460 --> 15:33.170
We're ready for pictures now!

15:35.290 --> 15:38.330
The two most talked-about
cosplayers are here, together!

15:38.330 --> 15:40.540
I can't believe they're at this event!

15:40.540 --> 15:42.540
I'm so glad I came!

15:42.880 --> 15:45.830
Next, let's do the pose from their Second Live!

15:46.420 --> 15:48.540
That's Coulia's debut scene!

15:48.920 --> 15:51.170
I love that part!

15:54.500 --> 15:55.460
Ririsa...

15:55.460 --> 16:00.420
Half an hour ago,
she was worried sick about Nonoa not liking her.

16:00.880 --> 16:02.880
They grow up so fast.

16:04.540 --> 16:06.790
Okay, I'm gonna snap some pics.
Hold my stuff.

16:06.790 --> 16:09.210
Wait, I thought I was the photographer here!

16:09.710 --> 16:11.170
We've only got ten minutes left!

16:11.170 --> 16:13.040
I'm going in, too!

16:13.460 --> 16:14.380
What's next?

16:16.250 --> 16:20.500
That's the pose from the album art
for my song, Angels Up!

16:21.210 --> 16:22.670
Even if I can't speak,

16:22.670 --> 16:26.080
I can communicate with my love for the game,
with cosplay.

16:27.130 --> 16:29.000
Thank you, Liliel-chan.

16:29.000 --> 16:32.540
It feels like I've finally made a friend!

16:33.380 --> 16:34.830
I'm so happy.

16:35.790 --> 16:37.500
Look over here!

16:44.210 --> 16:45.920
Thank you so much!

16:46.830 --> 16:49.170
Sorry for dragging you into my shoot.

16:49.170 --> 16:52.580
I just really wanted to get pictures with you.

16:58.830 --> 17:02.130
I'm sorry...
Even now, I still can't speak.

17:05.460 --> 17:07.500
I've gotta go. Thanks again.

17:10.420 --> 17:14.880
Ririsa, you sure you don't want
to get her number or anything?

17:16.580 --> 17:22.580
I would, but I've already bothered her enough.

17:23.210 --> 17:25.830
I can't change how Nonoa-chan feels.

17:25.830 --> 17:32.130
I told her how I feel,
and I don't want to keep pushing that on her.

17:35.460 --> 17:37.250
I said my piece.

17:37.250 --> 17:40.580
She's entitled to her own feelings about me.

17:41.290 --> 17:42.580
Okay.

17:47.500 --> 17:49.130
That's it, then.

17:49.790 --> 17:54.330
Liliel-chan already has lots of friends.
She doesn't need me.

17:54.750 --> 18:00.290
I got to live the dream for a moment.
That's enough for me.

18:02.580 --> 18:04.540
But is it, though?

18:05.130 --> 18:07.960
Didn't I come here to make friends with her?

18:07.960 --> 18:10.630
That's right. This can't be it.

18:10.630 --> 18:14.000
I'm not okay with things ending like this!

18:14.960 --> 18:19.380
I can't make friends. I'm fine being alone.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.000
Who was that?

18:21.750 --> 18:23.880
Liliel-chan is a good person.

18:23.880 --> 18:26.580
She was just being nice to me.

18:27.080 --> 18:29.750
There's no way she'd actually
want to be friends with me.

18:30.210 --> 18:32.580
Is that me?

18:32.580 --> 18:35.080
Don't get excited just because
someone was nice to you.

18:35.080 --> 18:38.290
I'll just end up bothering her.

18:38.290 --> 18:39.420
I'll embarrass myself.

18:39.420 --> 18:40.130
Shut up.

18:40.130 --> 18:41.130
You're weird.

18:41.130 --> 18:42.710
Stop it, shut up!

18:42.710 --> 18:44.330
This is easier.

18:44.330 --> 18:45.420
Stop!

18:45.710 --> 18:48.670
When I speak,
I just end up making things worse.

18:48.670 --> 18:51.750
When I try to involve myself with other people,
I just end up getting hurt.

18:51.750 --> 18:55.080
Stop it, stop it!
Why are you saying this?!

18:55.080 --> 18:58.250
Because everyone would be
better off if I didn't speak.

19:01.420 --> 19:02.460
Right...

19:03.040 --> 19:06.250
That's the person I turned myself into.

19:06.250 --> 19:09.960
The person I became after years of overthinking.

19:09.960 --> 19:15.040
I'll always be alone.
No one will ever want me.

19:15.580 --> 19:17.170
I won't have friends.

19:18.210 --> 19:22.790
I'll never be able to make friends.
I'll be alone forever.

19:22.790 --> 19:25.750
Stop it. You're not me!

19:26.250 --> 19:27.880
I'm Nonoa.

19:27.880 --> 19:29.040
You're not!

19:29.330 --> 19:31.540
You're the person I was,
until yesterday!

19:33.380 --> 19:35.210
I won't stay the same.

19:35.830 --> 19:37.750
I found the strength to speak.

19:38.290 --> 19:40.330
I told someone how I feel.

19:40.750 --> 19:43.130
I connected with someone I like!

19:45.880 --> 19:47.130
So what?

19:48.040 --> 19:51.000
I was Coulia.

19:51.000 --> 19:52.920
I was just playing make-believe.

19:52.920 --> 19:54.250
Who cares?!

19:54.920 --> 19:57.500
I can become someone I'm not!

19:57.500 --> 20:02.380
That means I can be someone different today!
A new me!

20:09.000 --> 20:10.630
I can change.

20:11.250 --> 20:13.830
I'm going to change!

20:21.290 --> 20:22.880
Nonoa-chan?

20:30.540 --> 20:31.380
Will...

20:31.790 --> 20:34.580
Will you be my friend?

20:42.130 --> 20:44.540
Yes! Of course I'll be your friend!

20:47.250 --> 20:48.790
I can change.

20:52.630 --> 20:54.750
I wonder if my past self would believe me...

20:52.630 --> 20:54.750
Don't cry, Nonoa-chan!

20:54.750 --> 20:56.460
I wonder if my past self would believe me...

20:57.670 --> 21:03.000
...if I told her my first friend
would be the angel I loved so dearly.

21:04.580 --> 21:06.170
That's great, Mikari-chan!

21:06.750 --> 21:08.500
Turn a little to the side for me?

21:09.420 --> 21:10.710
If I remember right,

21:09.420 --> 21:10.710
That's it! Perfect!

21:10.710 --> 21:11.330
Senpai was going to some event with everyone today.

21:10.710 --> 21:11.330
That's it! Perfect!

21:11.330 --> 21:14.330
Senpai was going to some event with everyone today.

21:14.880 --> 21:17.330
If I don't do something soon, then...

21:17.330 --> 21:19.880
Ooh, that serious expression is great!

21:20.630 --> 21:21.670
C'mon, focus!

21:22.960 --> 21:23.920
If my plan to win Senpai's heart by becoming

21:22.960 --> 21:23.920
Yes, perfect!

21:23.920 --> 21:25.000
If my plan to win Senpai's heart by becoming

21:25.000 --> 21:26.000
a famous model didn't work out,

21:25.000 --> 21:26.000
Now look at me!

21:26.000 --> 21:27.210
a famous model didn't work out,

21:27.210 --> 21:30.920
then I'm just going to have to
go with the cosplay plan after all!

21:32.290 --> 21:34.170
Okay, that's a wrap!

21:34.170 --> 21:35.880
Thank you!

21:35.880 --> 21:37.710
Could I borrow you for that interview now?

21:37.710 --> 21:38.830
Sure!

21:39.380 --> 21:40.580
I would, but...

21:40.580 --> 21:43.670
Going straight to the CEO won't help.

21:43.670 --> 21:48.250
Cosplay just wouldn't
work with our agency's strategy.

21:49.880 --> 21:54.130
It's crazy to believe you were
once extremely shy, Mikari-chan.

21:54.420 --> 21:57.170
I know, but once I've got
my mind set on something,

21:57.170 --> 21:58.630
I just go after it, you know?

21:58.880 --> 21:59.920
So I will.

22:00.330 --> 22:03.130
What do you like to do on your days off?

22:03.130 --> 22:05.170
I'll be strategic about this!

22:05.170 --> 22:07.080
I love to cosplay!

22:07.420 --> 22:09.920
Cosplay? Wow.

22:09.920 --> 22:12.330
Yeah, I'm super into it!

22:12.540 --> 22:16.920
I've been thinking about putting some of
my cosplay pics up on my social media!

22:17.460 --> 22:19.210
When was she going to tell me this?!

22:22.670 --> 22:25.420
Hope you're ready, Senpai!

23:56.040 --> 24:00.880
<b>I'll Keep Evolving</b>
